ge","line":18},{"title":"downloading an application from the ServiceNow Store","target":"download-app-first-time","line":50},{"title":"Set Threat Intelligence properties","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/c_GetStartedWithThreatIntel.md","line":55},{"title":"Find components installed with an application","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/find-components.md","line":61},{"title":"observables","target":"c_Observables","line":109},{"title":"indicators","target":"indicator","line":109},{"title":"attack patterns","target":"attack-patterns","line":148},{"title":"Attack modes and methods","target":"c_AttackModeMethod","line":164},{"title":"threat actor","target":"threat-actor","line":244},{"title":"Malware","target":"threat-intelligence-malware","line":256},{"title":"Sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":420},{"title":"Infrastructure","target":"threat-intelligence-infrastructure","line":536},{"title":"observed data","target":"threat-intelligence-observed-data","line":588},{"title":"threat reports","target":"threat-reports","line":596},{"title":"threat actors","target":"threat-actors","line":604},{"title":"tools","target":"tools","line":620},{"title":"Campaign","target":"campaign","line":640},{"title":"Identity","target":"identity","line":664},{"title":"Identities","target":"threat-intelligence-identities","line":668},{"title":"malware analysis","target":"threat-intelligence-malware-analysis","line":716},{"title":"Intrusion Set","target":"threat-intelligence-intrusion-sets","line":720},{"title":"Location","target":"location","line":744},{"title":"Marking Definition","target":"marking-definition","line":784},{"title":"Object Sighting","target":"object-sighting","line":792},{"title":"relationships","target":"stix-relationships","line":804},{"title":"Threat Grouping","target":"threat-grouping","line":888},{"title":"Threat Note","target":"threat-note","line":896},{"title":"Threat Opinion","target":"threat-opinion","line":904},{"title":"Threat Report","target":"threat-report","line":912},{"title":"threat lookup","target":"tisc-threat-lookup","line":987},{"title":"indicators of compromise","target":"c_IoCs","line":1146},{"title":"define a new REST message","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/web-services/t_ConfiguringARESTMessage.md","line":1253},{"title":"KB1213825","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB1213825","line":1262},{"title":"Download an application from the ServiceNow Store for the first time","target":"download-app-first-time","line":1345},{"title":"Threat Intelligence","target":"threat-intel-landing-page","line":1346},{"title":"Indicators","target":"indicator","line":1347},{"title":"Observables","target":"c_Observables","line":1348},{"title":"Attack patterns","target":"attack-patterns","line":1349},{"title":"Attack modes and methods","target":"c_AttackModeMethod","line":1350},{"title":"Threat Actor","target":"threat-actor","line":1351},{"title":"Malware","target":"threat-intelligence-malware","line":1352},{"title":"Sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":1353},{"title":"Infrastructure","target":"threat-intelligence-infrastructure","line":1354},{"title":"Observed data","target":"threat-intelligence-observed-data","line":1355},{"title":"Threat reports","target":"threat-reports","line":1356},{"title":"Threat actors","target":"threat-actors","line":1357},{"title":"Tools","target":"tools","line":1358},{"title":"Campaign","target":"campaign","line":1359},{"title":"Identity","target":"identity","line":1360},{"title":"Identities","target":"threat-intelligence-identities","line":1361},{"title":"Malware analysis","target":"threat-intelligence-malware-analysis","line":1362},{"title":"Intrusion set","target":"threat-intelligence-intrusion-sets","line":1363},{"title":"Location","target":"location","line":1364},{"title":"Marking Definition","target":"marking-definition","line":1365},{"title":"Object Sighting","target":"object-sighting","line":1366},{"title":"Relationships","target":"stix-relationships","line":1367},{"title":"Threat Grouping","target":"threat-grouping","line":1368},{"title":"Threat Note","target":"threat-note","line":1369},{"title":"Threat Opinion","target":"threat-opinion","line":1370},{"title":"Threat Report","target":"threat-report","line":1371},{"title":"Threat Lookup","target":"tisc-threat-lookup","line":1372},{"title":"Indicators of compromise","target":"c_IoCs","line":1373}],"metadata":{"title":"Set up Threat Intelligence","description":"Before you run Threat Intelligence in your instance, you must download it from the ServiceNow Store. You can also set up properties and define a threat source.Before you run Threat Intelligence in your instance, you must download it from the ServiceNow Store.Several types of components are installed with activation of the Threat Intelligence plugin, including tables and user roles.Threat Intelligence properties allow you to control how different aspects of the system function, including the setting of API keys.You can maintain a list of Threat Intelligence threat sources. Each source includes the ability to define how often a source is queried. You can also execute a threat source on demand to import the needed Structured Threat Information eXpression \\(STIX\\) data.You can maintain TAXII profiles for sharing STIX-formatted information. Each profile contains one or more TAXII collections or feeds.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/c\\_GetStartedWithThreatIntel.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":20,"breadcrumb":["Threat Intelligence","Enterprise security case management applications","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#type-concep